  "post_content": "<p>(14 fotos) Este lunes, 18 de enero, abre sus puertas en la calle Falcons, esquina Ros d&#39;Orsins, de Onda el nuevo establecimiento DietiNova, con varios servicios ofrecidos por Ascen Moreno Moreno, asesora en Dieta F&aacute;cil K7, t&eacute;cnica y coaching en diet&eacute;tica y nutrici&oacute;n, as&iacute; como en aparatolog&iacute;a corporal.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/01/IMG_20210114_170647.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n realizar&aacute; tests de nutrici&oacute;n, linfoterapia, bodyter premium, tratamientos corporales, l&aacute;ser diodo &#39;sheer desire&#39; o microblanding, y cosm&eacute;tica Gern&egrave;tic, basada en la alimentaci&oacute;n y nutrici&oacute;n celular</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170545.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210114_170545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170605.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210114_170605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170647.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210114_170647\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170721.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210114_170721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170820.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210114_170820\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170821.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210114_170821\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dietinova/img_20210114_170849.jpg\" alt=\"